  m_Name: C1LVL1M
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "Quite the fiesta in there, wasn\u2019t it?"
  - Or maybe it was closer to a warzone.
  - I enjoyed it, all the running and ducking? It was exciting!
  - "Even if my clothes got messed up, I\u2019m sure my parents would understand."
  - "In fact, I think they\u2019d be pretty happy to see that I found a friend!"
  - "I\u2019m sure yours would be glad too!"
  - Right?
